From d15667b0f7a07a88fd496a984c1848525e8389f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:51:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/78] Port the character sheet and the derived-stat
 recalculation

Port H065+$04B8 (character sheet), $0ADE (money), $0BE6 with its
nested $0BF4 (combat values) and $10DE (one stat line), the frame
H044+$068E, and from H063 the stat recalculation $13BE with $016A,
$0228, $0354, $0432, $06AE, $0758, $08A2, $18F8, $19B6 and
$1A8A, plus $0112, $0946, $09B2, $0FA0, $103A and $1F34 (trim,
effect lookup, item names, armour class, hit points, name).

Create New Character now draws the sheet and the rolled stats; it
stops at the unported training screen H013+$58DC.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
